  "editorHostStageTitle": "Stage에는 데스크톱 앱이 필요합니다",
  "@editorHostStageTitle": {
    "description": "Title of the Stage empty state shown when WaveCrux is running inside an editor panel. The panel is deliberately present and empty rather than hidden — an absent feature teaches nothing."
